The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/),
and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

## [Unreleased]

## [1.0.13] - 2026-10-08

### Fixed

- file_picker 12 AGP9/Kotlin + FilePicker API

### Added

- Fastlane android build

## [1.0.12] - 2026-10-08

### Fixed

- AGP9 allow legacy proguard-android.txt for flutter_inappwebview

## [1.0.11] - 2026-10-08

### Fixed

- Android Kotlin 2.2.20, AGP 9.0.1, Gradle 9.1.0 for Flutter Codemagic CI

## [1.0.9] - 2026-10-08

### Added

- Multi-stop rider : composition d'arrêts intermédiaires, payload `stops[]` fare/create, timeline d'itinéraire, progression `STOP_COMPLETED`, marqueurs numérotés sur recherche PENDING

### Changed

- Release 1.0.9+105

## [1.0.8] - 2026-10-02

### Fixed

- Android CI : Gradle wrapper 8.14 (minimum Flutter 8.14.0) pour `bundleRelease` Codemagic

## [1.0.7] - 2026-10-02

### Changed

- Release 1.0.7+103
- Dispatch auto F3 : retrait enchères passager, create avec `recommend_amount`, handler Pusher `driver_assigned`, réconciliation API

## [1.0.6] - 2026-07-24

### Changed

- Release 1.0.6+102
- Update Android/iOS launcher icons and Flutter `assets/icon/app_icon.png`

## [1.0.5] - 2026-07-21

### Changed

- Release 1.0.5+101

### Fixed

- Session drop after Home: reuse DI `ApiClient` singleton for Pusher auth / middleware / DI (empty secure token cache no longer triggers 401 to login)
- Ignore auth side-effects on `pusher/auth` 401/`unauthenticated` so realtime auth failures do not wipe the session
- Register Play App Signing SHA-1/SHA-256 in Firebase + refresh `google-services.json` OAuth client for Play Store installs

## [1.0.4] - 2026-07-20

### Changed

- Release 1.0.4+100

### Fixed

- Android Phone Auth `missing client identifier`: register debug keystore SHA + OAuth client for `sn.galass.galassrider` via FlutterFire (`google-services.json`)

## [1.0.3] - 2026-07-19

### Changed

- Align Android/iOS build number with production sequence: `1.0.3+99` (next after build 98)

## [1.0.2] - 2026-07-18

### Changed

- Release 1.0.2+3

## [1.0.1] - 2026-07-18

### Changed

- Release 1.0.1+2 (version SoT tooling + release.ps1 tag mirror flow)

## [1.0.0] - 2026-07-18

### Added

- Baseline Galass Rider app (Flutter, Android + iOS)
- Firebase Phone OTP -> Laravel `firebase-auth` session exchange
- Ride request, map, payment (Wave / Orange Money) surfaces
- Push notifications (FCM) and French (`fr_SN`) UI defaults
- Version source of truth tooling:
  - `scripts/bump_version.ps1` ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â SemVer+build bump, syncs `Environment.version`
  - `scripts/read_version.ps1` ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â machine-readable `BUILD_NAME` / `BUILD_NUMBER`
  - `scripts/release.ps1` ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â auto release: bump -> commit -> push -> tag `vX.Y.Z` -> push tag
- `docs/RELEASE.md` ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â process 1->3->2->4 (pubspec -> GitHub tag -> Codemagic build -> artifact)
- `docs/CODEMAPS/` ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â INDEX + app, auth, android, ios, ci
- Release hygiene tests under `test/release/` and `test/unit/version_sync_test.dart`

### Changed

- Local `codemagic.yaml` deprecated -> `codemagic.yaml.deprecated` (builds via Codemagic/Bitrise console; version from `pubspec.yaml`)
- Release flow: GitHub tag `vX.Y.Z` mirrors pubspec name; Codemagic trigger on tag `v*` (no CI build-number as SoT)

